      "params": {
        "text": "**Scale:** facilities built this way deliver far more energy per pulse, at far lower repetition rates, than the app's bounds allow.\nThe live model is normalized to 1 kHz / 1 kW: change the OPCPA gain, depletion, seed stretch or pump timing and watch the stage readout.",
